# Born effective charges and dielectric tensor for the NaCl fixture.
# Z*(Na) = +1.10 e and eps_inf = 2.34 are the values commonly quoted for rocksalt NaCl;
# they are literature-typical magnitudes, not the output of a calculation run here.
# Cubic site symmetry makes both tensors isotropic and the sum rule Z*(Na) + Z*(Cl) = 0
# is satisfied exactly.
# Line 1 = NAC unit conversion factor, line 2 = dielectric tensor, then one tensor/atom.
14.400
